KeyDown 9 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 150 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 100 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 41 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 41 1
Delay 64</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy’s The Division 2</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>